      "source": [
        "# Floor division\n",
        "\n",
        "Floor division, written `//`, divides and rounds the result down toward negative infinity. For example, `-3 // 2` is `-2`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-floor-division)"
      ]
    }
